<title>INDIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 327-5 V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 327-5 V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>MADRAS, India 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan were 327 for five</p>
<p>after their 50 overs against India in the last preliminary match</p>
<p>of the four-nation Independence Cup cricket tournament on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Pakistan 327-5 (Saeed Anwar 194)</p>
</text>
